  <attributes uuid="2ae3b2e5-4cc1-4c21-8e5d-c5361c7decd2">
    <name>JointApplicationOption</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Joint application option</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>گزینه اعمال مشترک</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Opzione dell'applicazione condivisa</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Wariant wspólnego zastosowania</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Вариант совместного применения</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Ortaklaşa uygulama seçeneği</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Phương án áp dụng chung</value>
    </synonym>
    <type>
      <types>EnumRef.OptionsOfJointUsageOfDiscountsAndMarkups</types>
    </type>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Determines the option according to which discounts (markups) from this group are calculated if they are used together.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>گزینه‌ای را تعیین می‌کند که تخفیف‌ها (افزایش قیمت‌ها)ی این گروه در صورت استفاده همزمان بر اساس آن محاسبه می‌شوند.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Determina la variazione in base alla quale vengono calcolati gli sconti (sovrapprezzi) del gruppo dato in caso dell'utilizzo congiunto.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Определяет вариант, в соответствии с которым рассчитываются скидки ( наценки) данной группы при совместном применении.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Bu gruptaki indirimlerin (zamların) birlikte kullanılması durumunda hesaplama yaparken hangi seçeneğin kullanılacağını belirler.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Xác định phương án, theo đó tính chiết khấu (phụ thu) của nhóm này khi áp dụng chung</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Determines the option according to which discounts (markups) from this group are calculated if they are used together.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <minValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <maxValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <fillChecking>ShowError</fillChecking>
    <fillFromFillingValue>true</fillFromFillingValue>
    <fillValue xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
      <value>Enum.OptionsOfJointUsageOfDiscountsAndMarkups.EnumValue.Max</value>
    </fillValue>
    <fullTextSearch>Use</fullTextSearch>
    <use>ForFolder</use>
    <dataHistory>Use</dataHistory>
  </attributes>
  <attributes uuid="c5b88ed1-13ba-4dba-8224-c522cbcd1676">
    <name>PriceKind</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Price type</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>نوع قیمت</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Tipo di prezzo</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Rodzaj ceny</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Вид цены</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Fiyat türü</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Dạng giá</value>
    </synonym>
    <type>
      <types>CatalogRef.TypesOfPrices</types>
    </type>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Discount amount is calculated as a difference between price type in the sales document line and price type specified in the discount.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>مبلغ تخفیف به صورت تفاوت بین نوع قیمت در سطر سند فروش و نوع قیمت مشخص‌شده در تخفیف محاسبه می‌شود.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>L'importo dello sconto è calcolato come la differenza fra il tipo di prezzo nella stringa del documento di vendita e il tipo di prezzo specificato nello sconto.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Suma rabatu jest rozliczana jako różnica między rodzajem ceny w wierszu dokumentu sprzedaży i wskazanym w rabacie rodzajem ceny.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Сумма скидки рассчитывается как разница между видом цены в строке документа продажи и указанным в скидке видом цены.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>İndirim tutarı, satış belgesinin satırındaki fiyat türü ile indirimde belirtilen fiyat türü arasındaki fark olarak hesaplanır.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Số tiền chiết khấu được tính như là chênh lệch giữa dạng giá trong dòng chứng từ bán hàng và dạng giá đã chọn trong chiết khấu </value>
    </toolTip>
    <minValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <maxValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <fillChecking>ShowError</fillChecking>
    <choiceParameters>
      <name>Filter.Status</name>
      <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
        <value>Enum.StatusesOfPriceTypeValidity.EnumValue.Valid</value>
      </value>
    </choiceParameters>
    <fillValue xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
      <value>Catalog.TypesOfPrices.EmptyRef</value>
    </fillValue>
    <fullTextSearch>Use</fullTextSearch>
    <dataHistory>Use</dataHistory>
  </attributes>
