  <attributes uuid="317cd924-a66e-4004-bd9a-d065dbc1025e">
    <name>SmartRounding</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Smart rounding</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>گرد کردن هوشمند</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Arrotondamento psicologico</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Zaokrąglenie psychologiczne</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Психологическое округление</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Psikolojik yuvarlama</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Làm tròn tâm lý</value>
    </synonym>
    <type>
      <types>DefinedType.MonetaryAmountNonNegative</types>
    </type>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Applied after rounding (for instance, the price is 29,99 instead of 30,00) to create an illusion of a lower price for a customer</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>پس از گرد کردن اعمال می‌شود (برای مثال، قیمت 29,99 به جای 30,00) تا تصور قیمت پایین‌تر برای مشتری ایجاد شود</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Si applica dopo l'arrotondamento (ad esempio se il prezzo è 29,99 e non precisamente 30,00) per suscitare la percezione nel cliente di un prezzo più basso</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Stosuje się po zaokrągleniu (na przykład, cena 29,99, zamiast 30,00) w celu utworzenia u klienta wrażenia niższej ceny</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Применяется после округления (например, цена 29,99, а не ровно 30,00) для создания у клиента впечатления более низкой цены</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Müşteride daha düşük bir fiyat izlenimi oluşturmak için yuvarlamadan (örneğin, tam olarak 30,00 yerine 29,99 fiyatında) sonra uygulanmaktadır</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Áp dụng sau khi làm tròn (ví dụ, 99 đồng thay cho 100 đồng) để tạo cảm giác giá thấp hơn đối với khách hàng</value>
    </toolTip>
    <minValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <maxValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <fillValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <fullTextSearch>Use</fullTextSearch>
    <dataHistory>Use</dataHistory>
  </attributes>
  <attributes uuid="6ff76327-f03f-44aa-b330-48764cfa7e24">
    <name>RoundUp</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Round up</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>گرد کردن به بالا</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
